BT 1 0 0 1 8 118 Tm /F1 10 Tf 16 TL 2.416364 Tw (Consider how Apple applies corporate finance: Capital Budgeting: Apple decided to invest) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.446923 Tw (billions in developing the iPhone \227 an NPV analysis must have suggested enormous future) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.978182 Tw (returns. Capital Structure: Apple historically held massive cash reserves \(low debt\). After) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.746923 Tw (investor pressure, it began borrowing cheaply to fund share buybacks \227 an optimal capital) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.406154 Tw (structure decision given low interest rates. Dividend Policy: Apple paid no dividend for years) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.661667 Tw (\(reinvesting in growth\). Once growth slowed, it introduced dividends and buybacks to return) Tj T* 0 Tw .377692 Tw (cash to shareholders. Each of these decisions required exactly the analysis taught in corporate) Tj T* 0 Tw (finance.) Tj T* ET
