BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 17 TL 1.429324 Tw (Every investment a business makes must clear a hurdle: the cost of capital. If your business's cost of) Tj T* 0 Tw .843375 Tw (capital is 12% \(what investors could earn elsewhere at similar risk\), then any project returning less than) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.009094 Tw (12% is actually destroying value, even if it's 'profitable.' Finance gives managers the tools to identify which) Tj T* 0 Tw (decisions create vs. destroy value.) Tj T* ET
