BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 17 TL .5083 Tw (The 2008 financial crisis. The dot-com bubble. Hyperinflation in Venezuela. The surge in interest rates in) Tj T* 0 Tw .650357 Tw (2022\2262023. Bitcoin's price swings. All of these events are fundamentally financial \227 caused by financial) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.415 Tw (decisions, analyzable with financial tools. Without financial literacy, these events seem mysterious and) Tj T* 0 Tw (frightening. With it, you can understand their causes and consequences.) Tj T* ET
